#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> Habitat-process loop: collect environment + health markers → compare baseline → notify on change, stay quiet otherwise.\n"
"> Related: [Issue #44](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/44) (partner-facing health warning), [`self-layer.md`](self-layer.md), [`notifications.md`](notifications.md).\n"
msgstr ""

